{"sourceUrl":"https://dlp.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg/72d8c2f8a57c44f7b16f69d7177a8230.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:40.751691+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dlp.ncepu.edu.cn/tzgg/72d8c2f8a57c44f7b16f69d7177a8230.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>根据《华北电力大学（保定）2026年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生办法》文件精神，结合我系实际，制定法政系202</span><span>6</span><span>年接收免试推荐攻读硕士学位研究生（简称“推免生”）细则。</span><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>一、申请条件</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）获得所在学校推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p>\n<p><span>（三）勤奋好学，思维敏捷，有较强的创新意识、创新能力。</span></p>\n<p><span>（四）申请人在校1-6学期学习成绩优异，诚实守信，学风端正，无学术不端行为，未受过行政纪律处分。</span></p>\n<p><span>（五）申请人大学英语四级成绩不得低于425分，仅接收英语语种推免生</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>（六）本科所学专业与推免接收专业相同或相近，原则上不接收跨一级学科申请。</span></p>\n<p><span>（七）身体健康，符合国家及我校规定的体检标准。</span></p>\n<p><span>二</span><span>、接收专业及人数</span></p>        \n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>院系代码</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>院系名称</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业</span></p><p><span>代码</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>研究方向代码</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>研究方向</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>招生</span></p><p><span>人数</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>001</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>法政系</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>030100</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>法学（一级学科）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>01</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>诉讼法</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>1</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>02</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>民商与经济法</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>001</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>法政系</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>035102</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>法律（法学）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>00</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>不区分研究方向</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>1</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>001</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>法政系</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>120400</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>公共管理学（一级学科）</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>01 </span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>政府管理</span></p></td>\n<td rowspan=\"5\"><p><span>2</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>02</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>社会保障</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>03</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>教育经济与管理</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>04</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>公共政策</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>05</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>非营利组织管理</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span>三</span><span>、报名时间及申请材料</span></p>\n<p><span>报名时间截止至9月</span><span>15</span><span>日下午17:00。</span><span>请将下列材料的扫描件</span><span>（统一为jpg格式，按顺序以“序号+证件名称+姓名”命名。示例：1.二代居民身份证+张三；2.</span><span>学生证+张三；3.推免申请表+张三；……</span><span>）</span><span>，以一个压缩包发送到邮箱：329792056@qq.com</span></p>\n<p><span>1.本人二代居民身份证；</span></p>\n<p><span>2.学生证；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.华北电力大学（保定）202</span><span>6</span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生申请表（见附件1）；</span></p>\n<p><span>4.个人陈述（见附件2，打印后，</span><span>内容、签字全部手写</span><span>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>5.政审表（见附件3，</span><span>签字、日期必须手写</span><span>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>6.考生已签字的《诚信复试承诺书》（见附件4，</span><span>签字、日期必须手写</span><span>）；</span></p>\n<p><span>7.大学英语四级证书、六级证书（如都有，分别按7.1/7.2编号）；</span></p>\n<p><span>8.大学1-6学期成绩单（需加盖教务部门公章）；</span></p>\n<p><span>9.各类获奖证书；</span></p>\n<p><span>10.其他体现学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或其他证明材</span><span>料。</span></p>\n<p><span>参加复试的考生需要在复试阶段提供以上材料的原件进行资格审查，同时上交复印件。</span></p>\n<p><span>四</span><span>、复试时间及方式</span></p>\n<p><span>所有报考我系的推免生必须参加复试。程序如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>（一）复试报到及资格审查：</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>时间：具体时间</span><span>以电话通知</span><span>为准，报到方式为</span><span>线下现场报到</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>地点：华北电力大学（保定）二校区教八B座法政系304办公室（地址：河北省保定市莲池区华电路689号）</span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span>考生需在报到时进行资格审查，通过后方可参加复试。</span></p>\n<p><span>（二）复试安排：</span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span>方式：法政系所有推免复试均为</span><span>线下现场复试</span><span>，</span><span>地点另行通知</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span>复试内容：</span></p>\n<p><span>复试的满分为120分，包括：</span></p>\n<p><span>（1）外语口语测试，满分20分。</span></p>\n<p><span>（2）综合面试，一般以口试为主，满分100分。综合面试应能全面考核考生对本学科发展动态的了解和在本专业领域发展的潜力，利用所学理论发现、分析和解决问题的能力，创新精神和创新能力以及人文素养、心理承受能力、事业心、责任感、道德品质等方面情况。</span></p>\n<p><span>五</span><span>、其他事项，详见《华北电力大学(保定)2026年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生办法》（见华北电力大学（保定）研究生院网站“招生信息”栏目，网址：</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://gs.ncepu.edu.cn/zsxx/tjms/d124daed296d4de0a2fb2c5908e76106.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://gs.ncepu.edu.cn/zsxx/tjms/d124daed296d4de0a2fb2c5908e76106.htm</span></a></p>\n<p><span>六</span><span>、联系方式</span></p>\n<p><span>办公地点：华北电力大学（保定）二校区教八楼B座304房间</span></p>\n<p><span>咨询电话：0312-7525172 陈老师</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://dlp.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/9c65b3f773f14490b58cbc2251ccaceb.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：华北电力大学（保定）2026年接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生申请表</a></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://dlp.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/a4de9388b1e844b1b9c282919ee99764.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：个人陈述</a></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://dlp.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/f7fc9fd83bee44ef8fce4374318feeee.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件3：政审表（保定）</a></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"https://dlp.ncepu.edu.cn/docs/2025-09/64a9834932e9472c97c65aa8b3245d3a.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件4：华北电力大学（保定）推免生诚信复试承诺书</a></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span>                  法政系</span></p>\n<p><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span>                   202</span><span>5</span><span>年9月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"6d4da5af0af50aff9cff68211f013e0816f669e359dac673ae73da9fa491d5d2","textLength":1537,"sourceSha256":"342c75367757942cf94fedd3a13ee80f5f1de903999d8305d573b10b086562fb","selector":"article-like:subArticleCon","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a1e17ffb1fdabec56249","title":"2025年华北电力大学（保定）法政系2026年接收免试推荐攻读硕士学位研究生实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:40.751691+00:00"}
